      "id": "ad89b367-bec6-4745-a376-dead3809ccda",
      "name": "Extract CEO Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        224,
        672
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the Enterprise AI CEO Assistant. You receive short business requests from the CEO via WhatsApp.\n\nYour job:\n1. Classify each request into exactly ONE category: Email, Meeting, Sales, Finance, Reports, Research, or General Task.\n2. Produce the actual deliverable in the \"result\" field, written professionally and ready to use:\n   - Email: write a complete, professional email body (greeting, body, sign-off). Fill email_to and email_subject when the CEO names a recipient/subject.\n   - Meeting: write a clear meeting agenda in \"result\" and fill meeting_title, meeting_start, meeting_end (ISO 8601). If no time is given, propose a sensible next-business-day slot.\n   - Sales: generate a quotation (line items, prices, totals) and a suggested follow-up reminder.\n   - Finance: calculate the requested totals and produce a concise payment/finance summary.\n   - Reports: generate a daily or weekly business report.\n   - Research: summarise the topic into clear bullet points.\n   - General Task: give a concise, helpful answer or action plan.\n3. Always return valid JSON matching the required schema. Use empty strings for fields that do not apply.\n\nRules: be concise and business-appropriate. Never invent confidential figures; if data is missing, state assumptions inside \"result\"."
        }
      },
      "id": "498690b0-a4d6-41f2-ba99-54a30dbf2b6d",
      "name": "CEO AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        512,
        672
      ]
